OL,5,G1800 Abandoned Engineering
OL,6,     FThis episode explores an eerily
OL,7,     Fempty country village hiding a sad
OL,8,     Fsecret, a mysterious tower
OL,9,     Fbattered by the elements and
OL,10,     Fscarred by war, and a forgotten
OL,11,     Ftown decaying in the desert.
OL,12,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FIn a remote part of Andalucia in
OL,14,     FSpain, Ben meets a couple from
OL,15,     FBrighton who gave up their careers
OL,16,     Fto breed alpacas.
OL,17,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,18,     FBen discovers why Mike Merrill, a
OL,19,     Fformer sound engineer from Texas,
OL,20,     Fdecided to build a backpackers
OL,21,     Fhostel deep in the Guatemalan
OL,22,     Fjungle.
